{"ID":"20240205153919-v2pvtkq","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153919-v2pvtkq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153919-v2pvtkq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095043-yvoqdou\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614111257-e3nkl94\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3700,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614111720-4u6eztw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"367补10豆豉（豉、淡豆豉、香豉、黑黄豆）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821190543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206095057-1ids6oo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095057-1ids6oo","updated":"20240206095100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t各地均产。\n【性状】\t该品呈椭圆形，略扁，长0.61cm，直径0.50.7cm。表面黑色，皱缩不平。质柔软，断面棕黑色。具有膜状种皮，气香，味微甘。\n【性味】\t辛、甘、微苦，寒。\n【功效】\t解肌发表；宣郁除烦。主治外感表证；寒热头痛；心烦；胸闷；虚烦不眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095052-kpulv2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095052-kpulv2k","updated":"20240206095052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095052-zldq71w.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704125527-mye2wdd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704125527-mye2wdd","updated":"20240704125527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 491px;","style":"width: 481px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"淡豆豉1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/淡豆豉1-20240704125527-7unhm11.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 481px;\" parent-style=\"width: 491px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704130229-v1zwklr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704130229-v1zwklr","updated":"20240821184612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 230px;","style":"width: 220px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704130636-5tkl92p.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 220px;\" parent-style=\"width: 230px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704130653-aaptzly.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 297px;","style":"width: 287px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704131338-o2faaae.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 287px;\" parent-style=\"width: 297px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704131544-8lz9s86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704131544-8lz9s86","updated":"20240821184613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 489px;","style":"width: 479px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑大豆"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑大豆-20240704131913-nl2onh7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 479px;\" parent-style=\"width: 489px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 709px;","style":"width: 699px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704132244-2bsnhoj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 699px;\" parent-style=\"width: 709px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704130913-yyt1cc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704130913-yyt1cc9","updated":"20240821184616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑大豆2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑大豆2-20240704132015-aq9x7h5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑大豆3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑大豆3-20240704132122-fgzte4b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 444px;","style":"width: 434px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑大豆4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑大豆4-20240704132217-l3ajrpu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 434px;\" parent-style=\"width: 444px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704132122-ews59o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704132122-ews59o6","updated":"20240704132724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 340px;","style":"width: 330px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704132724-7y7gme8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 330px;\" parent-style=\"width: 340px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 504px;","style":"width: 494px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704132634-ic3ukpe.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 494px;\" parent-style=\"width: 504px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821190543-2fmebmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821190543-2fmebmp","updated":"20240821190543"}},{"ID":"20240704130232-hlky3sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704130232-hlky3sa","updated":"20240821190522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黑大豆、黑豆对比"}]},{"ID":"20240704133213-xs3hq8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704133213-xs3hq8j","updated":"20240704133225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"-黑大豆"}]},{"ID":"20240704132333-jenzatu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704132333-jenzatu","updated":"20240704133655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 650px;","style":"width: 640px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704133650-7jeyeu4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 640px;\" parent-style=\"width: 650px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 423px;","style":"width: 413px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑大豆5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑大豆5-20240704132333-eefcl7k.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 413px;\" parent-style=\"width: 423px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704133227-80d56ad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704133227-80d56ad","updated":"20240704133230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"-黑豆"}]},{"ID":"20240704134557-38be9k5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704134557-38be9k5","updated":"20240704134701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704134557-j83qxa0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 321px;","style":"width: 311px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704134656-02spyx6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 311px;\" parent-style=\"width: 321px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704125257-h29r3i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704125257-h29r3i8","updated":"20240821184540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：淡豆豉一般由黑大豆制成，黑大豆是中国本土的大豆（产量较低，市面上已经很难买到了），市面上混淆品较多；"}]},{"ID":"20240704134715-p6z3kp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704134715-p6z3kp5","updated":"20240821185552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：黑大豆不等于黑豆，黑大豆跟黑豆相比，黑大豆表面不亮且颜色比较灰，形态比较圆，黑豆的表面则更光亮。"}]},{"ID":"20240821190131-r6rmvip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821190131-r6rmvip","updated":"20240821190148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：黑大豆是中国本土的大豆（易招虫害，产量低，市面上很难买到，抖音平台有部分创作者有留种），市面上混淆品较多；"}]},{"ID":"20240821190131-036ik3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821190131-036ik3r","updated":"20240821190303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"四注：黑大豆虽然产量低，但其打成的豆浆所含的能量比市面上的豆浆会高许多，喝完全身能持续暖和一段时间；"}]},{"ID":"20240614111138-2icjbuh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111138-2icjbuh"}},{"ID":"20240614111720-4u6eztw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-4u6eztw","updated":"20240614111727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豆豉《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-258hilc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-258hilc","updated":"20240614111720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸豆皆可为之，惟黑者入药。有盐淡二种，惟江右淡者治病。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-olhpw18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-olhpw18","updated":"20240614111730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"造淡豉法：六月内，用黑大豆二三斗，淘净，水浸一夜，沥干蒸熟。取出摊席上，候微温，蒿服覆，每三日下看，候黄衣上遍（不可太过），取晒簸净。以水拌干湿得所（汁出指间为准），安瓮中，筑实，桑叶盖，厚三寸，密封泥。于日中晒七日，取出曝一时，又以水拌入瓮，如此七次。再蒸过，摊去火气，瓮收筑封，即成矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-pofawdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-pofawdr","updated":"20240614111731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦甘而涩，气微温。（非苦温不能发汗开腠理，治伤寒头痛寒热及时气恶毒也。仲淳）　得醯良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-whrf722","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-whrf722","updated":"20240614111732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得葱则发汗，炒熟又能止汗。得盐则涌吐，得酒则治风，得薤则治痢，得蒜则止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-h0jojx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-h0jojx7","updated":"20240614111734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化气调中，散毒除烦。主春夏头痛寒热，时行热疾，烦躁满闷。并伤寒吐下后虚烦，劳复食复及余毒，止暴痢血痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-2fn3pri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-2fn3pri","updated":"20240614111736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方书治喘哮渴证，黄疸痛痹，耳气闭，鼻疳蚀。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-xquhbqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-xquhbqb","updated":"20240614111738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主虚劳喘吸，两脚疼冷。（《别录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-boex4oc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-boex4oc","updated":"20240614111720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物经蒸窨，故能升能散。（濒湖）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-yh5v6mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-yh5v6mc","updated":"20240614111740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调中下气最妙。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-eizlzet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-eizlzet","updated":"20240614111741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（又）伤寒有数种，猝不能别者，取一药兼疗之。凡初觉头疼，身热脉洪，一二日便以葱豉汤治之。用葱白一虎口，豉一升，绵裹。水三升，煮一升，顿服，取汗。更加葛根三两。（如此则知脾肾互为化源之义）再不汗，加麻黄三两。（《肘后方》）春夏之气不和，以豉蒸炒，酒渍服之，至佳。（贞白）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-x3z9ri9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-x3z9ri9","updated":"20240614111743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"热郁胸中，非宣剂无以除之。如伤寒短气烦躁，胸中懊憹，饥不欲食，虚烦不得眠者，用栀子豉汤吐之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-i8jpe48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-i8jpe48","updated":"20240617115351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脏毒下血。用淡豉十文，大蒜二枚煨，同捣丸梧子大。煎香菜汤服二十丸，日二服，安乃止，此药甚妙。但大蒜九蒸乃佳，以冷齑水送，能愈久疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-rfz5hof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-rfz5hof","updated":"20240614111720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血痢不止。亦用豉蒜等分杵丸，每服三十丸，盐汤下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-vtwt2r6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-vtwt2r6","updated":"20240614111747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[鼻勾]喘痰积，天雨便发，坐卧不得，饮食不进。乃肺窍久积冷痰，遇阴气触动则发。用淡豆豉一两，蒸捣如泥，入砒末一钱，枯矾一钱，丸绿豆大。每用冷茶水送下七丸，甚者九丸，小儿五丸。高枕仰卧，一服即愈。服至七八次，即出恶痰数升，药性亦随而出，病根永断矣。服后，忌食热物。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-v3wudo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-v3wudo1","updated":"20240614111749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒热喉痹不语。煮豉汁一升服，覆取汗，仍着桂木于舌下咽之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-6b69woz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-6b69woz","updated":"20240614111720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"风毒膝挛骨节痛。用豉三五升，九蒸晒，以酒一斗浸经宿。空心，随性温饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-l0ruckm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-l0ruckm","updated":"20240614111751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人难产，乃儿枕破与败血裹其子也。以胜金散逐其败血，即顺。用盐豉一两，旧青布裹了烧赤，研细，入麝香一钱，为末，取秤锤烧红淬酒，调服一大盏。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-gny0nod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-gny0nod","updated":"20240614111752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小儿胎毒。淡豆豉煎浓汁，与三五口，其毒自下。又能助脾气，消乳食。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111720-p0u8nj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111720-p0u8nj9","updated":"20240614111754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕味咸入肾。黑大豆为肾之谷，而味却甘，何也？盖足三阴同气于下，水土之合德以立地者，脾肾互为化原也。况肾气至肺，而脾气之至肺者，肾尤借之。咸合于甘，则脾气营运，而至阴生化之气，乃得极于上以通天。然则取豆制豉，是就营运之气，转为宣扬。濒湖所谓即经蒸罯，能升能散者也。（其味已由蒸罯变苦矣。兹仍本于色黑味甘以为论治之义者，缘脾与肾原相因以为病，唯此味适得脾肾之合也。）夫黑豆本以脾合于肾而达其生化，豆豉又为肾合于脾而致其宣扬。（是以伤寒初证投此，不及温热之初证尤为得宜。）能宣脾肾之气，令发达于脏腑以际周身，故方书主治举寒热虚实皆用之。观虚烦之治，在伤寒汗下后，固为伤其阳，更亡其阴。而杂证虚烦，亦属阴不能为阳之主，用淡豉化阴气而上奉于心，为脾肾宣扬生化之要剂也。（烦躁皆心火为病，类由肾阴不至于心。但心肾原是一气，而脾为坎离之交。绎此则《别录》主疗虚劳喘吸，洵有实功。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111138-jqz5ycx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111138-jqz5ycx"}},{"ID":"20240614111556-wagi8rp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111556-wagi8rp","updated":"20240614111559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豉《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111556-q28j1x0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111556-q28j1x0","updated":"20240614111556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒．主治伤寒、头痛、寒热、瘴气、恶毒、烦躁、满闷、虚劳、喘吸、两脚疼冷，又杀六畜胎子诸毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240614111138-jaaojk6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111138-jaaojk6"}},{"ID":"20240614111534-iykk36x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111534-iykk36x","updated":"20240614111541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豆豉《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111534-7lpnfjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111534-7lpnfjc","updated":"20240614111534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治发汗。解表。除烦。下气。伤寒头痛伤寒无汗伤寒余毒。时疾热病。骨蒸小便。此药得葱则发汗。得盐则涌吐。得酒则治风。得薤则治痢。炒熟则止汗。葱豉汤。葱白虎口。豉一升。水三升煎一升。顿服。不汗更作。加葛根三两。再不汗加麻黄三两。治伤寒无汗。乌犀散。淡豉十文。大蒜（煨）二枚。同捣丸梧子大。香菜煎汤服二十丸。日二次治脏毒下血。又方。豉葱白各半升。水二升煮至一升。顿服。治中酒成病。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111138-g52sbie","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111138-g52sbie"}},{"ID":"20240614111453-2xjzl9x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111453-2xjzl9x","updated":"20240614111458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豆豉《医方考》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111453-yaqiq19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111453-yaqiq19","updated":"20240614111523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喜食肥甘焦炙，令人消渴者，此物宜用。盖以豆豉由于盒造，味苦而气腐，苦能胜热，腐能胜焦故耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111138-g5um6jv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111138-g5um6jv"}},{"ID":"20240614111443-dfx56ve","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111443-dfx56ve","updated":"20240614111447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豆豉《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111443-p7up942","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111443-p7up942","updated":"20240614111443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"宣、解表除烦．"}]},{"ID":"20240614111443-8iaxrw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111443-8iaxrw7","updated":"20240614111443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦泄肺．寒胜热．（藏器曰∶豆性生平、炒熟热、煮食寒、作豉冷．）发汗解肌．调中下气．"}]},{"ID":"20240614111443-9hwjw48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111443-9hwjw48","updated":"20240614111443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治伤寒寒热头痛．烦躁满闷．懊 不眠．发斑呕逆．凡伤寒呕逆烦闷、宜引吐、不宜用下药以子豉汤、能吐虚烦．血痢温疟．疫气瘴气．（豆经蒸罨、能升能散、吐、得酒则治风、得薤则治痢、得蒜则止血、炒熟又能止汗、孟诜治用代麻黄汤、通治伤寒发表、亦治酒病．）伤寒直中三阴与传入阴经者勿用．热结胸烦闷．宜下不宜汗．亦忌之．造豉法、用黑豆．"}]},{"ID":"20240614111443-6zdei8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111443-6zdei8u","updated":"20240614111443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六月间水浸一宿．淘净蒸熟、摊芦席上．微温．蒿覆五六日后．黄衣遍满为度．不可太过．"}]},{"ID":"20240614111443-jbytxkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111443-jbytxkh","updated":"20240614111443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取晒簸净．水拌干湿得所．以汁出指间为准．筑实瓮中．桑叶浓盖三寸．泥封．晒七日．取出曝一时．又水拌入瓮．如是七次．再蒸过．摊去火气．瓮收．"}]},{"ID":"20240614111138-gttd245","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111138-gttd245"}},{"ID":"20240614111432-v8lrw49","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111432-v8lrw49","updated":"20240614111435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豆豉《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111432-0qkd190","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111432-0qkd190","updated":"20240614111432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豆豉苦寒无毒，表汗吐烦及劳复，定喘止痢更安胎，脚痛痈肿敷且服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111432-swc89ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111432-swc89ue","updated":"20240614111432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即常用豆豉，不入盐者佳。纯阴。主伤寒头痛寒热，一切时行瘴毒，和葱白服之，发汗最速。又能吐虚烦躁闷，心中懊 ，劳复食复，兼定虚劳喘急，暴痢腹痛，血痢，胎动血下。两脚疼冷，浸酒服之，以渣外敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111432-v446fmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111432-v446fmk","updated":"20240614111432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"作饼灸发背痈肿。又杀六畜胎子诸毒，中毒药蛊气，殴跌瘀血聚腹，疟疾骨蒸，犬咬。单方∶治阴茎疮痛烂，豉一分，蚯蚓湿泥二分，水研涂，干则易之。又中蛤蟆毒，便闭脐痛，水煮服之。头风痛煎汤浴之即瘥。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111139-qd0ymi2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111139-qd0ymi2"}},{"ID":"20240614111418-825md7w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111418-825md7w","updated":"20240614111425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豆豉《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111418-46fim9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111418-46fim9z","updated":"20240614111418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宣，解表，除烦"}]},{"ID":"20240614111418-yjbequi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111418-yjbequi","updated":"20240614111418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦泄肺、寒胜热（陈藏器曰∶豆性生平，炒熟、热煮食寒，作豉冷）。发汗解肌，调中下气。治伤寒头痛，烦躁满闷，懊 不眠，发斑呕逆（凡伤寒呕逆烦闷，宜引吐，不宜用下药以逆之。淡豉合栀子，名栀子豉汤，能吐虚烦），血痢温疟（时珍曰∶黑豆性平，作豉则温，既经蒸 ，故能升能散。得葱则发汗，得盐则能吐，得酒能治风，得薤则治痢，得蒜则止血，炒熟又能止汗。孟诜治盗汗，炒香渍酒服。《肘后》∶合葱白煎，名葱豉汤，用代麻黄汤，通治伤寒，发表，亦治酒病）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111418-gjxegb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111418-gjxegb0","updated":"20240614111418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"造淡豉法，用黑大豆水浸一宿，淘净蒸熟，摊匀，蒿复，候上黄衣，取晒，簸净，水拌，干湿得所，安瓮中，筑实。桑叶浓盖，泥封。晒七日取出，曝一时，又水拌入瓮。如此七次，再蒸，去火气，瓮收用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111652-jyp6t92","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111652-jyp6t92"}},{"ID":"20240614111653-dc9wn2t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111653-dc9wn2t","updated":"20240614111657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豆豉《本草思辨录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111653-zzchv74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111653-zzchv74","updated":"20240614111653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豉别录苦寒。李氏谓∶黑豆性平，作豉则温，既经蒸 ，故能升能散。窃谓仲圣用作吐剂，亦取与栀子一温一寒，一升一降，当以性温而升为是。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111653-lwtqk7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111653-lwtqk7p","updated":"20240614111653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别录主烦躁，而仲圣止以治烦不以治躁。若烦而兼躁，有阳经有阴经∶阳经则用大青龙汤、大承气汤，阴经则用四逆汤、甘草干姜汤、吴茱萸汤，皆无用淡豉者。盖阳经之烦躁，宜表宜下；阴经之烦躁，宜亟回其阳。淡豉何能胜任。别录以主烦躁许之，殊有可商。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111653-cblo86a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111653-cblo86a","updated":"20240614111653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烦有虚有实∶虚者正虚邪入而未集，故心中懊 ；实者邪窒胸间，故心中结痛。虽云实，却与结胸证之水食互结不同，故可以吐而去之。证系有热无寒，亦于肾无与。所以用豉者，豉苦温而上涌，栀泄热而下降，乃得吐去其邪，非以平阴逆也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111653-3797snq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111653-3797snq","updated":"20240614111653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"张氏谓淡豉主启阴精上资，而邹氏遂以此为治伤寒头痛及瘴疠恶毒之据，不知其有毫厘千里之失。盖伤寒初起，与瘴疠恶毒，虽身发热，实挟有阴邪在内，故宜于葱豉辛温以表汗，或协人中黄等以解毒。何资于阴脏之精。且淡豉亦何能启阴脏之精者。试煎淡豉尝之，便欲作恶，可恍然悟矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111653-ba0nbc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111653-ba0nbc4","updated":"20240614111653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豉温而非寒，亦不治躁，确然可信。邹氏过泥别录，遂致诠解各方，忽出忽入，自相径庭。黑大豆本肾谷，蒸 为豉，则欲其自肾直上。因其肾谷可以治肾，故千金崔氏诸方，用以理肾家虚劳。因其为豉不能遽下，故与地黄捣散与地黄蒸饭。邹氏谓于极下拔出阴翳诚是。乃其解葱豉汤，既谓宜于病起猝难识别，又谓是热邪非寒邪。不知葛稚川立方之意，以初起一二日，头痛恐寒犯太阳，脉洪又恐热发阳明，投以葱豉，则邪解而阴阳两无所妨，正因难辨而出此妙方，宜后世多奉以为法。煎成入童便者，以葱豉辛温，少加童便，则阴不伤而与藏气相得。如淡豉本寒，更加以童便之寒，葱白虽辛而亦寒，外达之力，必致大减，恐无此制剂之理也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111653-655j7zo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111653-655j7zo","updated":"20240614111653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"邹氏又以素问气寒气凉，治以寒凉，行水渍之，注家谓热汤浸渍，则寒凉之物能治寒凉，于是引伤寒论用豉诸方，皆不以生水煮，为合以寒治寒之旨。金匮栀子大黄汤，不以治寒，则四味同煮，不分先后。噫！邹氏误矣。所云注家，殆近世不求甚解者耳。按气寒谓北方，气凉谓西方，跟上节西北之气句来，治以寒凉行水渍之，跟上节散而寒之句来，上言其理，此明其治。王太仆注云∶西北方人皮肤腠理密，人皆食热，故宜散宜寒。散谓温浴，使中外条达，行水渍之，是汤漫渍。张隐庵云∶西北之气寒凉，人之阳热遏郁于内，故当治以寒凉。行水渍之者，用汤液浸渍以取汗。合二说观之，经所谓渍，定是浴以取汗，今西北方人惯用此法，并非以热汤渍寒药。若谓以热汤渍寒药，即可以治寒病，则药物不胜用矣。然则栀子豉汤，先煮他药后煮淡豉何故？盖此与泻心用麻沸汤渍之绞汁无异耳。豉本肾谷，欲其上达，故不多煮，大凡用豉以取吐取汗，法皆如是。取汗如枳实栀子豉汤，煮豉止一二沸，以有枳实抑之，故用豉至一升，而煮则一二沸无妨也。栀子大黄汤四味同煮，则以不取吐不取汗，自宜多煮，豉用一升，亦以所偶为大黄枳实，而豉尚欲其治上也。他若金匮瓜蒂散，则以生水煮取吐矣。但豉用七合，不云下水若干，以生水任煮而不为之限，可见必欲竭豉之力。味浓则下趋易，或疑此与吐法不悖乎。不知吐宿食与吐寒饮不同，吐宿食自当少抑其上浮之性。虽抑之，而以苦温之淡豉，偶苦寒之瓜蒂，甘酸之赤豆，终必激而上行。且苦寒甘酸者杵为散，苦温者煮取汁，皆有一升一降，故拂其性以激发之义，安在不为吐法。邹氏于经旨方意，咸未彻悟，强为扭合，不免自误以误人矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111636-qe9khfy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111636-qe9khfy"}},{"ID":"20240614111637-5ac2puu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111637-5ac2puu","updated":"20240614111641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豆豉《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111637-pztdwh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111637-pztdwh0","updated":"20240614111637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒，发汗解肌，泄肺除热，下气调中，炒熟又能止汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111621-heo4gl3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111621-heo4gl3"}},{"ID":"20240614111139-tayurpz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111139-tayurpz","updated":"20240614111144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豉《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111139-ldt667m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111139-ldt667m","updated":"20240614111139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦。性寒。无毒。能升能降。阴中阴也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111139-chzley1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111139-chzley1","updated":"20240614111139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主伤寒头痛寒热。瘴气恶毒。烦躁满闷。两脚疼冷。（别录）疟疾。骨蒸。犬咬。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111139-j3rs2xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111139-j3rs2xw","updated":"20240614111139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中盗汗【归经】入肺经。入胃经。为解表除烦之品。（解肌发汗下气调中）【前论】博物志曰。豉得葱则发汗。得盐则能吐。得酒则治风。得薤则治痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111139-3myl7c3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111139-3myl7c3","updated":"20240614111139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得蒜则止血。炒熟则止汗。亦麻黄根节之义也。士材曰。豉之入肺。所谓肺苦气上逆。急食苦以泄之之义也。伤寒瘴气。肺先受之。喘吸烦闷。亦肺气有余耳。何弗治耶。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111139-fn18h1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111139-fn18h1e","updated":"20240614111139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【禁忌】经疏曰。伤寒传入阴经。与直中三阴者。皆不宜用。热结胸中。烦闷不安。此欲成以上宣剂谷部"}]},{"ID":"20240614111314-owxut0a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111314-owxut0a"}},{"ID":"20240614111315-cz1bsic","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111315-cz1bsic","updated":"20240614111319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豆豉《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111315-1d8q1g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111315-1d8q1g7","updated":"20240614111315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦、寒，无毒。主伤寒头痛寒热，瘴气恶毒，烦燥满闷，虚劳喘吸，两脚疼冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111609-rdgr1qs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111609-rdgr1qs"}},{"ID":"20240614111610-ibj8lb7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111610-ibj8lb7","updated":"20240614111615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豆豉《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111610-qywt3cn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111610-qywt3cn","updated":"20240614111610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒．入手太阴经．功专泄肺清热．下气调中．得葱则发汗．得山栀则吐．得盐亦吐．得酒治风．得薤治痢．得蒜止血．炒熟又能止汗．若伤寒直中三阴与传入阴经及热结胸烦闷．宜下不宜汗者．均须忌服．"}]},{"ID":"20240614111140-lfwjvzd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111140-lfwjvzd"}},{"ID":"20240614111150-r7dhd5w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111150-r7dhd5w","updated":"20240614111156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豉《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111150-vyo2x9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111150-vyo2x9h","updated":"20240614111150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主伤寒，头痛寒热，瘴气恶毒，烦躁满闷，虚劳喘吸，两脚疼冷。又杀六畜胎子诸毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111150-n0ic8ge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111150-n0ic8ge","updated":"20240614111150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶豉，食中之常用。春夏天气不和，蒸炒以酒渍服之，至佳。根据康伯法∶先以醋酒溲蒸曝燥，以麻油和，又蒸曝之，凡三过，乃末椒、干姜屑合和，以进食，胜今作油豉也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111150-tkxeo7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111150-tkxeo7c","updated":"20240614111150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患脚人常将其酒浸，以滓敷脚皆瘥。好者出襄阳、钱塘，香美而浓，取中心者弥善。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶豆豉，得 良，杀六畜毒，味苦、甘。主下血痢如刺者，豉一升，水渍才令相淹，煎一、两沸，绞汁顿服。不瘥可再服。又伤寒暴痢腹痛者，豉一升，薤白一握切，更煮，汤色黑去豉，分为二服。不瘥再服。熬末能止汗，主除烦躁。治时疾热病，发汗。又治阴茎上疮痛烂，豉一分，蚯蚓湿泥二分，水研和涂上，干易，禁热食酒、菜、蒜。又寒热风，胸中疮，生者可捣为丸服，良。陈藏器云∶蒲州豉，味咸，无毒。主解烦热，热毒，寒热，虚劳，调中，发汗，通关节，杀腥气，伤寒鼻塞。作法与诸豉不同，其味烈。陕州又有豉汁，经年不败，大除烦热，入药并不如今之豉心，为其无盐故也。孟诜云∶豉，能治久盗汗患者，以一升微炒令香，清酒三升渍，满三日取汁，冷暖任人服之，不瘥，更作三、两剂即止。日华子云∶治中毒药，蛊气，疟疾，骨蒸，并治犬咬。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111150-wwfaidk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111150-wwfaidk","updated":"20240614111150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具大豆黄卷条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111150-l02tlbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111150-l02tlbq","updated":"20240614111150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食疗云∶陕府豉汁，甚胜于常豉。以大豆为黄蒸，每一斗加盐四升，椒四两，春三日，夏两日，冬五日即成。半熟，加生姜五两，既洁且精，胜埋于马粪中。黄蒸，以好豉心代之。圣惠豉心以足为限，但觉刺即熟嚼豉以敷之，少顷见豉中毛即瘥。不见，又嚼敷之，昼夜勿绝，见毛为度不语升，水三升之，搅取汁饮豉三升，少艾烈其上灸之，使温温而灸之。如先有疮孔中汁出分为三服，日二作。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111150-0v9wp1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111150-0v9wp1x","updated":"20240614111150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合，日三，无比。又，各上出血如针孔。取豉三出不解，已三、四日，胸中方∶辟温疫法∶熬豉和白术十四枚锉，水三升，煎取一升，心镜∶主风毒，脚膝挛急，骨节痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111150-93zw6fc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111150-93zw6fc","updated":"20240614111150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饮之。又方∶小儿寒热，恶气中人。以摩心、脐上，旋旋祝之了，破豉丸看有细毛黄泥聚豉煨熟，冷后取出豆豉为末，以豉、大蒜等分，一处杵匀，丸如梧子大。每服后毒瓦斯攻手足及身体虚肿豉酒方∶豉五合微炒姚和众治小儿丹毒，破作疮，黄水出。焦炒豉令热病后攻目生翳者。烧豉二七枚，末，以管吹之治堕胎血下尽烦满。豉一升，水三升，三沸煮为末敷之，不过三、四次。茆亭客话∶虾蟆小者有毒，主人小便闭涩，脐下憋，疼痛至死者。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111150-fwdl0pw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111150-fwdl0pw","updated":"20240614111150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以生豉一合，投新汲水半碗，浸令水浓，顿饮之，愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111151-5mmll0u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111151-5mmll0u"}},{"ID":"20240614111210-cmxcv3e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111210-cmxcv3e","updated":"20240614111217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豆豉《本草经解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111210-wuda3pt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111210-wuda3pt","updated":"20240614111210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气寒．味苦．无毒．主伤寒头痛寒热．瘴气恶毒．烦躁满闷．虚劳喘吸．两脚疼冷．豆豉气寒．禀天冬寒之水气．入足太阳寒水膀胱经、手太阳寒水小肠经．味苦无毒．得地南方之火味．入手少阴心经、手少阳相火三焦经．气味俱降．阴也．伤寒有五．风寒湿热温．当其初伤太阳也．太阳经行于头．而本寒标热．故必头痛寒热．豆豉气寒能清．味苦能泄．所以主之也．瘴气恶毒．致烦躁满闷．热毒郁于胸中．非宣剂无以除之．故用豆豉苦寒．所以涌之也．虚劳喘吸．火乘肺也．两脚疼冷．火上而不降也．豆豉苦寒足以清火．清上则火自降．所以皆主之也．"}]},{"ID":"20240614111210-o75rm5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111210-o75rm5r","updated":"20240614111210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制方】"}]},{"ID":"20240614111210-iiwhz77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111210-iiwhz77","updated":"20240614111210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豆豉同葱白．治伤寒初起．同薤白．治血利．"}]},{"ID":"20240614111211-75obi2a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111211-75obi2a"}},{"ID":"20240614111232-77r94qh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111232-77r94qh","updated":"20240614111242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豆豉《雷公炮制药性解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111232-7yhrinv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111232-7yhrinv","updated":"20240614111232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，性寒无毒，入肺经。主伤寒头痛寒热，恶毒瘴气，烦躁满闷，虚劳喘吸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111232-09lngao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111232-09lngao","updated":"20240614111232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按∶豉之入肺，所谓肺苦气上逆，急食苦以泄之之意也。伤寒瘴气，肺先受之，喘吸烦闷，亦肺气有余耳，向弗治耶。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111233-icis4jp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111233-icis4jp"}},{"ID":"20240614111246-xod2xc1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111246-xod2xc1","updated":"20240614111250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豆豉《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111246-facr7q2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111246-facr7q2","updated":"20240614111246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味则甘苦微温．两行肺胃．主治凡风寒时疫．专赖宣疏．能发汗以解肌．可吐邪而化腐．（豆豉用黑豆蒸熏而成．虽诸家本草言性寒者多．然既经蒸熏．则味甘者变苦．其性岂有寒冷之理．入肺胃．行上焦．有宜发升散之力．故凡一切时温温疟等证．内有伏邪表里不解者．均可用之．所谓在表者汗而发之．在上者因而越之．须知豆豉能化胸中陈腐之气．则解表宣里之力．自可知矣．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111246-tcz4u6g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111246-tcz4u6g"}},{"ID":"20240614111255-lyzd797","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-lyzd797","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：淡豆豉"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-w7n621o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-w7n621o","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-e98lckv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-e98lckv","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Dàn Dòu Chǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-j55jzpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-j55jzpy","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-rmac0qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-rmac0qw","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为豆科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大豆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Glycine max（L.） Merr. 的成熟种子的发酵加工品。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-2kz9wxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-2kz9wxc","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-j6j2r0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-j6j2r0f","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈椭圆形，略扁，长0.6～1cm，直径0.5～0.7cm。表面黑色，皱缩不平。质柔软，断面棕黑色。气香，味微甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-2kyftxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-2kyftxk","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-sz6hkhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-sz6hkhr","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-qkptzga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-qkptzga","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-wu1685v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-wu1685v","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取桑叶、青蒿各70～100g，加水煎煮，滤过，煎液拌入净大豆1000g 中，俟吸尽后，蒸透，取出，稍凉，再置容器内，用煎过的桑叶、青蒿渣覆盖，闷使发酵至黄衣上遍时，取出，除去药渣，洗净，置容器内再闷15～20天，至充分发酵、香气溢出时，取出，略蒸，干燥，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-kmfabr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-kmfabr4","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-5r5crux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-5r5crux","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取本品1g，研碎，加水10ml，加热至沸，并保持微沸数分钟，滤过。取滤液0.5ml ，点于滤纸上，待干，喷以1％ 吲哚醌－醋酸（10:1）的混合溶液，干后，在100～110℃加热约10分钟，显紫红色。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-tcgoq0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-tcgoq0i","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-0qwcgf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-0qwcgf4","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肺、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-gq38ib9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-gq38ib9","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-xyskatc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-xyskatc","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦、辛，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-vktehpv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-vktehpv","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-3nlii3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-3nlii3j","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解表，除烦，宣发郁热。用于感冒、寒热头痛，烦燥胸闷，虚烦不眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-3qcniqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-3qcniqk","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-1tm1szv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-1tm1szv","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 6～12g。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-zdjqstt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-zdjqstt","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-h6y7qsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-h6y7qsh","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-qfvjse7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-qfvjse7","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：淡豆豉"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-4c2am1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-4c2am1l","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-hoqis55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-hoqis55","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Dàn Dòu Chǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-byfi3do","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-byfi3do","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-bo08e2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-bo08e2g","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 豆豉、杜豆豉"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-udlq49j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-udlq49j","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-7gojnup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-7gojnup","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 豆科大豆属植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大豆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Glycine max （L.） Merr.的成熟种子经过一定的炮制方法加工而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-d3gnu7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-d3gnu7h","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-syir4tp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-syir4tp","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取桑叶、青蒿，置锅内加水煎汤，过滤，取药汤与洗净的黑豆拌匀，汤吸尽后置笼内蒸透，取出，略晾，再置容器内上盖煎过的桑叶、青蒿渣，闷至发酵生黄衣为度，取出，晒干即得。（每黑豆100斤，用桑叶4斤，青蒿7斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-g2x3a29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-g2x3a29","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-32geqdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-32geqdl","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛、甘、微苦，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-rnu3emr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-rnu3emr","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-d4olrjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-d4olrjg","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解表，除烦。用于感冒发热，头痛，虚烦，失眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-yvhvira","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-yvhvira","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-bg5sov5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-bg5sov5","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 2～5钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-hel62m0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-hel62m0","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-9z6ybln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-9z6ybln","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-w2irn3s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-w2irn3s","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：淡豆豉"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-o82aqp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-o82aqp8","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-sgrew92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-sgrew92","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Dàn Dòu Chǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-xxqdnyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-xxqdnyc","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-5mddjhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-5mddjhv","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 香豉（《伤寒论》），淡豉（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-h6wzzrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-h6wzzrm","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-j3ewl7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-j3ewl7i","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草汇言》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-2bfk4gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-2bfk4gq","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-lxqsvko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-lxqsvko","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为豆科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大豆的种子经蒸罨加工而成"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-jbgicd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-jbgicd1","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-dvmkb9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-dvmkb9v","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 植物形态详\"黑大豆\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-llfvo81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-llfvo81","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-xxq8zp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-xxq8zp7","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥品呈椭圆形，略扁，长0.5～1厘米，宽3～6毫米。外皮黑色，微有纵横不整的皱折，上有黄灰色膜状物。外皮多松泡，有的已脱落，露出棕色种仁。质脆，易破碎，断面色较浅。有霉臭，昧甘。以色黑、附有膜状物者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-lpgvhth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-lpgvhth","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-xw7z2xx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-xw7z2xx","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肺、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-z9c25ad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-z9c25ad","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肺经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-ub8l1ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-ub8l1ow","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经解》：\"入足太阳膀胱、手太阳小肠、手少阴心、手少阳三焦经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-qrhzdkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-qrhzdkc","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《要药分剂》：\"入肺、胃二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-hmfja5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-hmfja5h","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-md6lf0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-md6lf0w","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-udrvng6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-udrvng6","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"味苦，寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-aefwbb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-aefwbb8","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《千金·食治》：\"味苦甘，寒，涩，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-rh1flzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-rh1flzb","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《珍珠囊》：\"苦咸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-5l3li8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-5l3li8s","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-psjbuqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-psjbuqf","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《药性论》：\"得酰良。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-gt7aoob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-gt7aoob","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"凡伤寒传入阴经与夫直中三阴者，皆不宜用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-1v7dcz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-1v7dcz4","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-5yazgu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-5yazgu5","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解表，除烦，宣郁，解毒。治伤寒热病，寒热，头痛，烦躁，胸闷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-niypr8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-niypr8n","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》；\"主伤寒头痛寒热，瘴气恶毒，烦躁满闷，虚劳喘吸，两脚疼冷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-4sova6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-4sova6k","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"治时疾热病发汗；熬末，能止盗汗，除烦；生捣为丸服，治寒热风，胸中生疮；煮服，治血痢腹痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-16ikfg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-16ikfg3","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"治中毒药，疟疾，骨蒸；并治犬咬。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-iqkq5bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-iqkq5bt","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《珍珠囊》：\"去心中懊憹，伤寒头痛，烦躁。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-9zxw7hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-9zxw7hq","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"下气，调中。治伤寒温毒发癍，呕逆。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-jgdggw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-jgdggw1","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本经逢原》：\"以水浸绞汁，治误食鸟兽肝中毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-gbcsvgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-gbcsvgv","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《会约医镜》：\"安胎孕。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-goizloo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-goizloo","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-qnbd3lt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-qnbd3lt","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，2～4钱：或入丸剂。外用：捣敷或炒焦研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-4wie2t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-4wie2t8","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-wg440tv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-wg440tv","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治发汗吐下后，虚烦不得眠，心中懊憹：栀子十四个（擘），香豉四合（绵裹）。上二味，以水四升，先煎栀子，得二升半，纳豉，煮取一升半，去滓。分为二服，温进一服，得吐者止后服。（《伤寒论》栀子豉汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-31m6vrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-31m6vrm","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治温毒发斑，大疫难救：黑膏生地黄半斤（切碎），好豉一升，猪脂二斤。合煎五六沸，令至三分减一，绞去滓，末雄黄、麝香如大豆者纳中，搅和，尽服之，毒从皮中出。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-143kp8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-143kp8r","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治伤寒暴下及滞痢腹痛：豉一升，薤白一把（寸切）。上二物，以水三升，煮令薤熟，去滓，分为再服，不瘥复作。（《范汪方》鼓薤汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-1dvnrrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-1dvnrrz","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治多年肺气喘急，呴嗽，晨夕不得眠：信砒一钱半（研飞如粉），豆豉（好者）一两半（水略润少时，以纸浥干，研成膏）。上用膏子和砒同杵极匀，丸如麻子太，每服十五丸，小儿量大小与之，并用极冷腊茶清临卧吞下，以知为度。（《本事方》紫金丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-a5tii3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-a5tii3t","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治断奶乳胀：豆豉半斤，水煎，服一小碗，余下洗乳房。（广西《中草药新医疗法处方集》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-u8zr2dh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-u8zr2dh","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治小儿丹毒破作疮，黄水出：焦炒豉，令烟绝为末，油调敷之。（姚和众）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-m1eibcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-m1eibcn","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治阴茎上疮痛烂：豉一分，蚯蚓湿泥二分，水研和涂上，干易，禁热食韭菜、蒜。（《药性论》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-2xr9r7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-2xr9r7q","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-yob5yrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-yob5yrv","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"黑豆性平，作豉则温。既经蒸罯，故能升能散；得葱则发汗，得盐则能吐，得酒则治风，得薤则治痢，得蒜则止血；炒熟则又能止汗，亦麻黄根节之义也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-r0o7s62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-r0o7s62","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"豉，惟江右淡者治病。《经》云，味苦寒无毒，然详其用，气应微温。盖黑豆性本寒，得蒸晒之气必温，非苦温则不能发汗、开腠理、治伤寒头痛、寒热及瘴气恶毒也。苦以涌吐，故能治烦躁满闷，以热郁胸中，非宣剂无以除之，如伤寒短气烦躁，胸中懊憹，饿不欲食，虚烦不得眠者，用栀子豉汤吐之是也。又能下气调中辟寒，故主虚劳。喘吸，两脚疼冷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-c7oa6x1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-c7oa6x1","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》：\"淡豆豉，治天行时疾，疫疠瘟瘴之药也。王绍隆曰：此药乃宣郁之上剂也。凡病一切有形无形，壅胀满闷，停结不化，不能发越致疾者，无不宣之，故统治阴阳互结，寒热迭侵，暑湿交感，食饮不运，以致伤寒寒热头痛，或汗吐下后虚烦不得眠，甚至反复颠倒，心中懊憹，一切时灾瘟瘴，疟痢斑毒，伏痧恶气，及杂病科痰饮，寒热，头痛，呕逆，胸结，腹胀，逆气，喘吸，脚气，黄疸，黄汗，一切沉滞浊气搏聚胸胃者，咸能治之。倘非关气化寒热时瘴，而转属形藏实热，致成痞满燥实坚者，此当却而谢之也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-c7oaxy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-c7oaxy6","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本经疏证》：\"豆豉治烦躁满闷，非特由于伤寒头痛寒热者可用，即由于瘴气恶毒者亦可用电。盖烦者阳盛，躁者闭逆，阳盛而不得下交，阻逆而不能上济，是以神不安于内，形不安于外，最是仲景形容之妙，曰反复颠倒，心中懊憹。惟其反复颠倒，心中懊憹，正可以见上以热盛，不受阴之滋，下因阴逆，不受阳之降，治之不以他药，止以豆豉栀子成汤，以栀子能泄热下行，即可知豆豉能散阴上逆矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-wvlbcqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-wvlbcqe","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"制法"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-dzw4lhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-dzw4lhi","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取桑叶、青蒿加水煎汤，过滤，取药汤与洗净的黑大豆拌匀，俟汤吸尽后，置笼内蒸透，取出略凉，再置容器内，上盖煎过的桑叶、青蒿渣，闷至发酵生黄衣为度，取出，晒干即得。（每黑大豆100斤，用桑叶4斤、青蒿7斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-bo3ij2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-bo3ij2u","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《纲目》：\"造淡豉法，用黑大豆二三斗，六月内淘净，水浸一宿，沥干蒸熟，取出摊席上，候微温，蒿覆。每三日一看，候黄衣上遍，不可太过。取晒簸净，以水拌干湿得所，以汁出指间为准，安瓮中，筑实。桑叶盖，厚三寸，密封泥，于日中晒七日，取出，曝一时，又以水拌入瓮。如此七次，再蒸过，摊去火气，瓮收筑封即成。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-745qo5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-745qo5n","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡豉制法，除上述加工法而外，尚有以其它药物如辣蓼、佩兰、苏叶、藿香、麻黄、青蒿、羌活、柴胡、白芷、川芎、葛根、赤芍、桔梗、甘草等，或煎取药汁，用以煮豆；或将药物研成粉末同煮熟的大豆拌和，然后闷置发酵等不同的加工方法。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-3ev6fti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-3ev6fti","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-7jytj56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-7jytj56","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-6a76e7d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-6a76e7d","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：淡豆豉"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-8jtvvgt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-8jtvvgt","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-re73avd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-re73avd","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Dàn Dòu Chǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-pgpvb09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-pgpvb09","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-w8vmj14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-w8vmj14","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黄豆、白豆"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-tznkw5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-tznkw5r","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-ezs2icw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-ezs2icw","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fermented Soybean"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-82kbxsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-82kbxsp","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-feepahp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-feepahp","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为豆科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大豆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Glycine max（L.）Merr.的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"种子的发酵加工品"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-t4fmltk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-t4fmltk","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-8czgr2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-8czgr2p","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国各地均有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-0qwfcd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-0qwfcd6","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-t86vaeh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-t86vaeh","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 一年生草本，高50～150cm。茎多分枝密生黄褐色长硬毛。三出复叶，叶柄长达20cm,密生黄色长硬毛；小叶卵形、广卵形或狭卵形，两侧的小叶通常为狭卵形，长5～15cm,宽3～8.5cm；旗瓣倒卵形，翼瓣长椭圆形，龙骨瓣斜倒卵形。荚 果带状矩形，黄绿色或黄褐色，密生长硬毛，长5～7cm，宽约1cm。种子2～4粒，卵圆形或近球形。花期6～7月，果期7～9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-63f22cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-63f22cp","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-3z2u35w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-3z2u35w","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 加工后的种子呈椭圆形，略扁，长0.6～1cm，直径0.5～0.7cm。表面黑色，皱缩不平。质柔软，断面棕黑色。气香，味微甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-1f94z45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-1f94z45","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-z4ccsxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-z4ccsxp","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 种子含蛋白质、脂肪、胆碱、黄嘌呤（xanthine）、次黄嘌呤（hypoxanthine）、胡萝卜素、维生素B1、B2、烟酸、天冬酰胺、甘氨酸、笨丙氨酸、亮氨酸、异亮氨酸等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-2j5bahq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-2j5bahq","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-n2n879s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-n2n879s","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性凉，味苦、辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-13mtdi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-13mtdi0","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-j5wzixh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-j5wzixh","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解表，除烦，宣发郁热。用于感冒、寒热头痛、烦燥胸闷、虚烦不眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-2uo2nck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-2uo2nck","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-byhqrxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-byhqrxe","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-oe4cp1z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-oe4cp1z","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：淡豆豉"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-8hsr3ps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-8hsr3ps","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-ufeazmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-ufeazmo","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Dàn Dòu Chǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-ozxg9i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-ozxg9i2","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-a33fbeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-a33fbeu","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 香豉、豉、淡豉、大豆豉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-xflv2ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-xflv2ua","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-a13i47k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-a13i47k","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fermented Soybean"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-355im9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-355im9v","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-lpi34cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-lpi34cf","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《本草汇言 》。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-l8l6bhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-l8l6bhd","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《肘后方》：伤寒有数种，今取一药兼疗。若初觉头痛，肉热，脉供，起一、二日，便作此加减葱豉汤。葱白一虎口，豉一升，锦裹，以水三升，煮取一升，顿服取汗。若不汗更作，加葛根三两，不汗更作，加麻黄三两，去节。诸名医方皆用此，更有加减法甚多。今江南人凡得时气，必先用此汤服之，往往便瘥。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-t07qkth","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-t07qkth","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240614111255-evson7z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-evson7z","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240614111255-u3q9nda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-u3q9nda","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶弘景中豉，食中之常用，春夏天气不和，蒸炒以酒渍服之，至佳。暑热烦闷，冷水渍饮"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-u8s65qq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-u8s65qq","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-t9ungfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-t9ungfh","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为豆科植物大豆Glycine max（L.）Merr.的黑色的成熟种子经蒸罨发酵等加工而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-7hn331j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-7hn331j","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Glycine max（L.）Merr.[Phaseolus max L.]"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-ct8fgha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-ct8fgha","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-nt8g8we","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-nt8g8we","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：全国各地广泛栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-u8be3zv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-u8be3zv","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-4492bmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-4492bmp","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大豆 一年生直立草本，高60-180cm。茎粗壮，密生褐色长硬毛。叶柄长，密生黄色长硬毛；托叶小，披针形；三出复叶，顶生小叶菱状卵形，长7-13cm，宽3-6cm，先端渐尖，基部宽楔形或圆形，两面均有白色长柔毛，侧生小叶较小，斜卵形；叶轴及小叶柄密生黄色长硬毛。总状花序腋生；苞片及小苞片披针形，有毛；花萼钏状，萼齿5，披针形，下面1齿最长，均密被白色长柔毛；花冠小，白色或淡紫色，稍较萼长；旗瓣先端微凹，翼瓣具1耳，龙骨瓣镰形；雄蕊10，二体；子房线形，被毛。荚果带状长圆形，略弯，下垂，黄绿色，密生黄色长硬毛。种子2-5颗，黄绿色或黑色，卵形至近球形，长约1cm。花期6-7月，果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-bi3u23c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-bi3u23c","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-cnl1ht0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-cnl1ht0","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品呈椭圆形略扁，长0.6-1cm，直径0.5-0.7cm。表面黑色，皱缩不平，无光泽，一侧有棕色的条状种脐，珠孔不明显。子叶2片，肥厚。质柔软，断面棕黑色。气微，味微甘。以粒大、饱满、色黑者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-zlvk4st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-zlvk4st","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-sp1qlhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-sp1qlhw","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品含蛋白质19.5%，脂肪6.9%，碳水化合物25%，维生素B10.07mg/100g，维生素B20.34mg/100g，烟酸2.4mg/100g；另含钙、铁、磷盐、氨基酸以及酶。又谓，从发酵大豆中分离出四甲基吡嗪(tetramethylpyrazine)。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-avgbgdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-avgbgdr","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-upmkwy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-upmkwy6","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取桑叶、青蒿加水煎汤，过滤，取药汤与洗净的黑大豆拌匀，俟汤吸尽后，置笼内蒸透，取出略凉，再置容器内，上盖煎过的桑叶、青蒿渣，闷至发酵生黄衣为度，取出，晒干即得。(每黑大豆100斤，用桑叶4斤、青蒿7斤)《纲目》： 造淡豉法，用黑大豆二三斗，六月内淘净，水浸一宿，沥干蒸熟，取出摊席上，候微温，蒿覆。每三日一看，候黄衣上遍，不可太过。取晒簸净，以水拌干湿得所，以汁出指间为准，安瓮中，筑实。桑叶盖，厚三寸，密封泥，于日中晒七日，取出，曝一时，又以水拌人瓮。如此七次，再蒸过，摊去火气，瓮收筑封即成。淡豉制法，除上述加工法而外，尚有以其它药物如辣蓼、佩兰、苏叶、藿香、麻黄、青蒿、羌活、柴胡、白芷、川芎、葛根、赤芍、桔梗、甘草等，或煎取药汁，用以煮豆；或将药物研成粉末同煮熟的大豆拌和，然后闷置发酵等不同的加工方法。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-09yw40d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-09yw40d","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-tmfsye9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-tmfsye9","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 （1）取本品1g研碎，加水10ml，加热至沸，并保持微沸数分钟，滤过，取滤液0.5ml，点于滤纸上，待干，喷以1%吲哚醌-醋酸（10：1）的混合液，干后，在100-110℃烘约10min，显紫红色。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-x1ileya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-x1ileya","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品1g，研碎，加水10ml，在50-60℃水浴中温浸1h，滤过，取滤液1ml，加1%硫酸铜液与40%氢氧化钾溶液各4滴，振摇，应无紫红色出现。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-qa0i6e1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-qa0i6e1","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-b5g31uc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-b5g31uc","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺；胃；心；膀胱；小肠；三焦经"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-bkujkh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-bkujkh7","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-b7y3xkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-b7y3xkn","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦；辛；平"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-96w8xkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-96w8xkp","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-zj0pspc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-zj0pspc","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《药性论》：得XI良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-klpx14w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-klpx14w","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：凡伤寒传人阴经与夫直中三阴者，皆不宜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-itst8wp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-itst8wp","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-n1edw70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-n1edw70","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解肌发表；宣郁除烦。主外感表证；寒热头痛；心烦；胸闷"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-hw4yykh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-hw4yykh","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-k8mw15v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-k8mw15v","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，5-15g；或入丸剂。外用：适量，捣敷；或炒焦研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-yuguogo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-yuguogo","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-v45e0fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-v45e0fe","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治发汗吐下后，虚烦不得眠，心中懊憹： 栀子十四个(擘)，香豉四合(绵裹)。上二味， 以水四升，先煎桅子，得二升半，纳豉，煮取一升华，去滓。分为二服，温进一服，得吐者止后服。(《伤寒论》栀子豉汤)②治温毒发斑，大疫难救： 黑膏生地黄半斤(切碎)，好豉一升，猪脂二斤。合煎五六沸，令至三分减一，绞去滓，末雄黄、麝香如大豆者纳中，搅和，尽服之；毒从皮中出。(《补缺肘后方》)③治伤寒暴下及滞痢腹痛： 豉一升，薤白一把(寸切)。上二物，以水三升，煮令薤熟，去滓，分为再服，不瘥复作。(《范汪方》豉薤汤)④治多年肺气喘急，呴嗽，晨夕不得眠：信砒一钱半(研飞如粉)，豆豉(好者)一两半(水略润少时，以纸浥干，研成膏)。上用膏子和砒同杵极匀， 丸如麻子大。每服十五丸，小儿量大小与之，并用极冷腊茶情临卧吞下，以知为度。(《本事方》紫金丹)⑤治断奶乳胀： 豆豉半斤，水煎，服一小碗，余下洗乳房。(广西《中草药新医疗法处方集》)⑥治小儿丹毒破作疮，黄水出： 焦炒豉，令烟绝为末，油调敷之。(姚和众)⑦治阴茎上疮痛烂： 豉一分，蚯蚓湿泥二分，水研和涂上，干易，禁热食韭菜、蒜。(《药性论》)"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-emkwq8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-emkwq8q","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-7xznb4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-7xznb4x","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：黑豆性平，作豉则温。既经蒸署，故能升能散；得葱则发汗，得盐则能吐，得酒则治风，得薤则治痢，得蒜则止血；炒熟则又能止汗，亦麻黄根节之义也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-isetqa7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-isetqa7","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：豉，惟江右谈者治病。《经》云，味苦寒无毒，然详其用，气应微温。盖黑豆性本寒，得蒸晒之气必温，非苦温则不能发汗、开腠理、治伤寒头痛、寒热及瘴气恶毒也。苦以涌吐，故能治烦躁满闷，以热郁胸中，非宣剂无以除之，如伤寒短气烦躁，胸中懊憹，饿不欲食，虚烦不得眠者，用栀子豉汤吐之是也。又能下气调中辟寒，故主虚劳、喘吸，两脚疼冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-fjf6mpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-fjf6mpw","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草汇言》：淡豆豉，治天行时疾，疫疠瘟瘴之药也。王绍隆曰：此药乃宣郁之上剂也。凡病一切有形无形，壅胀满闷，停结不化，不能发越致疾者，无不宣之，故统治阴阳互结，寒热选侵，暑湿交感，食饮不运，以致伤寒寒热头痛，或汗吐下后虚烦不得眠，甚至反复颠倒，心中澳憹，一切时灾瘟瘴，疟痢斑毒，伏痧恶气，及杂病科痰饮，寒热，头痛，呕逆，胸结，腹胀，逆气，喘吸，脚气，黄疸，黄汗，一切沉滞浊气搏聚胸胃者，咸能治之。倘非关气化寒热时瘴，而转届形藏实热，致成痞满燥实坚者，此当却而谢之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-z5w1itr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-z5w1itr","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本经疏证》：豆鼓治烦躁满闷，非特由于伤寒头痛寒热者可用，即由于瘴气恶毒者亦可用也。盖烦者阳盛，躁者阴逆，阳盛而不得下交，阴逆而不能上济，是以神不安于内，形不安于外，最是仲景形容之妙，曰反复颠倒，心中澳憹。惟其反复颠倒，心中懊憹，正可以见上以热盛，不受阴之滋，下因阴逆，不受阳之降，治之不以他药，止以豆豉栀子成汤，以栀子能泄热下行，即可知豆豉能散阴上逆矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-x0b2823","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-x0b2823","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《别录》：主伤寒头痛寒热，瘴气恶毒，烦满闷，虚劳喘吸，两脚疼冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-yl30h3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-yl30h3q","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《药性论》：治时疾热病发汗；熬末，能止盗汗，除烦；生捣为丸服，治寒热风，胸中生疮；煮服，治血痢腹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-fz048pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-fz048pg","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《日华子本草》：治中毒药，疟疾，骨蒸；并治犬咬。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-fe58a9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-fe58a9d","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《珍珠囊》：去心中懊憹，伤寒头痛，烦躁。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-tryindp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-tryindp","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《纲目》：下气，调中。治伤寒温毒发癍，呕逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-k5las2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-k5las2y","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本经逢原》：以水浸绞汁，治误食鸟兽肝中毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-eywquo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-eywquo4","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《会约医镜》：安胎孕。"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-5g41zqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-5g41zqe","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614111255-t5xd1eh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111255-t5xd1eh","updated":"20240614111255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614111256-udgqhak","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614111256-udgqhak"}},{"ID":"20240614111257-e3nkl94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614111257-e3nkl94"}}]}